invariant: INV-5
file: webpki_ext.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
reason: read_basic_constraints accepts bytes after the BasicConstraints
  SEQUENCE inside the extnValue, so a pathLenConstraint written outside
  the SEQUENCE is read as if the SEQUENCE held it. The basicConstraints
  boundary mutants object.

